<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Case Manager AI — production deployment manifest.

  Hand-curated. Every member below is named; there is no wildcard, because a
  wildcard on GenAiPromptTemplate previously swept four unrelated templates and
  a blocked one into this package.

  NO DATA STORAGE. Morning_Brief__c and Case_Manager_AI_Log__e were removed on
  2026-08-18 at the user's direction — this feature persists nothing. The morning
  digest is still computed by CaseManagerAIDigestService, live per request, and
  Brief_Priority__mdt is kept because a Custom Metadata Type is configuration
  rather than data and costs no storage.

  DELIBERATELY ABSENT, and each for a reason:
    Status_Config__mdt                     not in source control anywhere
    RecordContextProvider(Test)            blocked on Status_Config__mdt and
                                           PaymentPlan__c.Scheduled_Count__c
    GenericRecordContextProvider           superseded; queries without USER_MODE
    AgentforceCaseSummaryController(Test)  grounds on apex://RecordContextProvider
    agentforceCaseSummary (LWC)            same dependency
    Case_Executive_Summary (template)      same dependency
    Bot / GenAiPlannerBundle / GenAiPlugin / GenAiFunction
                                           the agent is rebuilt in production
    Agentforcesummary (static resource)    zero bytes, referenced by nothing

  Deploy order is handled by the platform, but note that Brief_Priority__mdt
  rows ARE the trigger rules: without them no trigger fires at all.
-->
